OL,3,GNEWSAMet refers itself to police
OL,4,Awatchdog over letter about Meghan's
OL,5,Afather
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Metropolitan Police has referred
OL,8,Fitself to the police complaints
OL,9,Fwatchdog over its handling of a letter
OL,10,Fwith allegations against Thomas Markle,
OL,11,Fwhich was handed to his daughter, the
OL,12,FDuchess of Sussex, in 2019.
OL,14,FThe letter, written by Markle's first
OL,15,Fwife Roslyn Loveless, is believed to
OL,16,Fhave contained claims about Meghan's
OL,17,Ffather.
OL,19,FMarkle has strongly denied recent
OL,20,Fallegations that he had possessed
OL,21,Fimages of child abuse, describing them
OL,22,Fas "sick lies".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
