OL,3,GNEWSAMet refers itself to police
OL,4,Awatchdog over letter about Meghan's
OL,5,Afather
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe force said it had voluntarily
OL,8,Freferred itself to the Independent
OL,9,FOffice for Police Conduct (IOPC) "in
OL,10,Frespect of the decision not to inform
OL,11,Fother law enforcement agencies, and the
OL,12,Fdecision to pass the letter to the
OL,13,Foffice of the Duke and Duchess of
OL,14,FSussex."
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
